https://github.com/nihui/rife-ncnn-vulkan

Local modifications for kdenlive-morphcut:
- rife.cpp: SPIR-V caches are kept per shader variant (tta / model generation),
  so several engines with different settings can coexist in one process.
- rife.cpp: model path buffers enlarged (snprintf, 4096 bytes).
- warp.cpp: pack8 pipeline disabled (removed from ncnn's Vulkan backend).
- rife.h/rife.cpp: configurable input padding for RIFE v4 (v4.25/v4.26 need 64),
  taken from https://github.com/TNTwise/rife-ncnn-vulkan (MIT), which also
  provides the newer v4.x models in models/.
